      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erudin Burning [zone=752]\n**Who:**\n- Kordian Keshalian [npc=36060]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 18 22:07:19 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Kordian Keshalian in Erudin Burning (location -285, 220 -- the east corner as you approach the Spirit of Erud)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kordian Keshalian'\nKordian Keshalian says '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, I know you must have just arrived, but I must ask you to [join the fight] against the heretics. There is so much at stake at the moment.'\nYou say, 'I'll join the fight'\nKordian Keshalian says 'Take down a good number of them and check in with me regularly on your kills.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'On the Rebound'.\n\n---\n\nDispose of a number of Heretics 0/10 (Erudin Burning)\nReport back to Kordian Keshalian 0/1 (Erudin Burning)\nYou say, 'Hail, Kordian Keshalian'\nKordian Keshalian says, 'I can always use your assistance any time. Thank you.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers",
