      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erudin Burning [zone=752]\n**Who:**\n- Illithi Nollith [npc=36212]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a book dervish [npc=36244]\n- a tome dervish [npc=36255]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 4 20:02:38 2010\nModified: Thu Jun 16 18:03:11 2011 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Illithi Nollith in Erudin Burning. She is located at -330, 370 (on the same platform along with the General and the Spirit of Erud -- in the area south of the dock)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Illithi Nollith'\nIllithi Nollith says 'The books! Our precious tomes of knowledge. The last look I had at our library, it was up in flames. The heretic forces were infusing evil spirits into our tomes, using them against us. Please, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, could you [release the spirits] taking over our knowledge?'\nYou say, 'I'll release the spirits'\nIllithi Nollith says 'Thank you, adventurer. We must persevere!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Possessing a Tome'.\nIllithi Nollith is worried for the tomes left to the library, which was being taken as she retreated to sanctuary. The librarian has requested that you release the spirits that have taken over many of the tomes.\n\n---\n\nKill several book dervishes, releasing the spirits within 0/3 (Erudin Burning)\nKill several tome dervishes, releasing the spirits within 0/3 (Erudin Burning)\nSpeak with Illithi Nollith 0/1 (Erudin Burning)\nYou say, 'Hail, Illithi Nollith'\nIllithi Nollith says, 'Thank you for your help. Here is to hoping the stores of knowledge live on to the next generation.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
