      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Erudin Burning [zone=752]\n**Who:**\n- Laoni Reista [npc=36211]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Nightmare Shard [item=92109]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Terris Thule apostle [npc=36252]\n- a Terris Thule cultist [npc=36253]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 4 20:02:47 2010\nModified: Sat Mar 12 18:42:59 2011 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Laoni Reista in Erudin Burning. She is located at -330, 260 (in the same area as the General and the Spirit of Erud -- the area south of the dock)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Laoni Reista'\nLaoni Reista says 'Greetings, friend. If you're here to [help], we can use all the help we can get.'\nYou say, 'How can I help?'\nLaoni Reista says 'The undead make up a significant amount of their army, and continue to be a grave threat against our people. If you could [take down] several of the undead forces, it would help considerably. Alternatively, I am collecting Nightmare Shards for our researchers to examine a source of the Terris Thule cultists' power. If you wanted to [gather one], it would assist in our research.'\nYou say, 'I'll gather one'\nLaoni Reista says 'Not every cultist has one, and it would do us well to thin their forces while you searched. I will be here and look forward to your return.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Source of Nightmares'.\nLaoni Reista has requested that you take down Terris Thule cultists and bring back to her a Nightmare Shard. While you are working on that task, she has also asked that you help thin their forces as well.\n\n---\n\nDispose of a number of Terris Thule cultists and apostles 0/5 (Erudin Burning)\n_Terris Thule mobs are found in the southern part of the zone in the area around the library._\nRetrieve a Nightmare Shard 0/1 (Erudin Burning)\nDeliver a Nightmare Shard to Laoni Reista 0/1 (Erudin Burning)\nLaoni Reista says, 'Took down a number of them and found a Nightmare Shard? I'll hand this to our researchers immediately. Thank you greatly for your assistance.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
